			"notes": "## TotemAutomata 0.1.22\n\n- Adds a module-owned Totem Automata Creative Mode tab for the Copper Wrench.\n- Makes source and destination lines follow the Copper Golem's interpolated\n  client position every render frame while retaining server-authoritative links.\n- Keeps eight visible allow and deny rules per pane and adds independent,\n  row-based scrolling with visible ranges when either list exceeds that limit.\n- Extends native client and Observer regression coverage for the updated UI.\n- Requires TotemCore 0.7.14 or newer within the 0.7.x compatibility line.\n\nMinecraft 26.2 · Fabric · Java 25"
		},
